for each `id~default~` in `id~default~^{asterisk}^`
     ...... Check that `typeIR'''''^?^` is Some value, for all `typeIR'''''^?^` in `typeIR'''''^?^^{asterisk}^`.
     ...... Let `typeIR~b_default~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `typeIR~b_default~`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
            * Let `?typeIR~b_default~` be `typeIR'''''^?^`.
