. Group :
 .. Let `(parameterTypeIR~data~^{asterisk}^, parameterTypeIR~control~^{asterisk}^)` be `<<split_dataplane_parameters, $split_dataplane_parameters(parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^)>>`.
 .. Let `argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^` be the result of <<Call_convention_ok, checking the calling convention of `argumentIR^{asterisk}^` applied to parameter types `parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^`, under cursor `LOCAL`, typing context `TC`, and action context `ACTION`>>.
 .. Result in the typed argument list `parameterTypeIR~data~^{asterisk}^`.


relation TableDefaultAction_ok: `TC`, `TBLC`, and `= expression`


. If let `prefixedNonTypeName` be `expression`:
 .. Group prefixedNonTypeName:
  ... Let `prefixedNameIR` be <<prefixedNonTypeName, the prefixed name of  `prefixedNonTypeName`>>.
  ... Check that ?(`[ ]`, `[ ]`) is equal to `<<find_action, $find_action(TBLC, prefixedNameIR)>>`.
  ... Result in the typed default action `prefixedNameIR ( [ ] )`.
. Else if let `callExpression` be `expression`:
 .. Let!~type~ `callTarget ( argumentList )` be `callExpression`.
