   .... Check that the length of `TBLC.KEYS` is equal to 1.
   .... Let <<TableEntry_keysets_simple_ok, `TC TBLC NOLPM |- TBLC.KEYS @ [expression~l~ .. expression~r~] : TBLS simpleKeysetExpressionIR'^{asterisk}^`>>.
   .... Let!~type~ `[simpleKeysetExpressionIR]` be `simpleKeysetExpressionIR'^{asterisk}^`.
   .... Result in the updated table context `TBLS` and the typed keyset expression `( [simpleKeysetExpressionIR] )`.
 .. Else if `tupleKeysetExpression` matches pattern `( DEFAULT )`:
  ... Group tupleKeysetExpression-default:
   .... Let `matchMode` be `TBLC.MODE`.
   .... Let!~type~ `NOPRILPM n` be `matchMode`.
   .... Let `TBLS` be `LPM n`.
