   .... If `TBLC.MODE` matches pattern `NOPRI`:
    ..... Let `TBLS` be `NOLPM`.
    ..... Result in the updated table context `TBLS` and the typed keyset expression `( [DEFAULT] )`.
   .... Else if `TBLC.MODE` matches pattern `PRI`:
    ..... Let `TBLS` be `NOLPM`.
    ..... Result in the updated table context `TBLS` and the typed keyset expression `( [DEFAULT] )`.
   .... Else if `TBLC.MODE` matches pattern `PRILPM`:
    ..... Let `TBLS` be `NOLPM`.
