 .. Else if `tupleKeysetExpression` matches pattern `( _ )`:
  ... Group tupleKeysetExpression-dontcare:
   .... Let `matchMode` be `TBLC.MODE`.
   .... Let!~type~ `NOPRILPM n` be `matchMode`.
   .... Let `TBLS` be `LPM 0`.
   .... Result in the updated table context `TBLS` and the typed keyset expression `( [_] )`.
   .... If `TBLC.MODE` matches pattern `NOPRI`:
