   .... Else if `TBLC.MODE` matches pattern `PRI`:
    ..... Let `TBLS` be `NOLPM`.
    ..... Result in the updated table context `TBLS` and the typed keyset expression `( [_] )`.
   .... Else if `TBLC.MODE` matches pattern `PRILPM`:
    ..... Let `TBLS` be `NOLPM`.
    ..... Result in the updated table context `TBLS` and the typed keyset expression `( [_] )`.
 .. Else let `( simpleKeysetExpression~h~ , simpleKeysetExpressionList~t~ )` be `tupleKeysetExpression`:
