relation TableEntry_priority_ok: `TC`, `tableContext'`, `TBLS`, and `tableEntryPriority''^?^`


. If `tableEntryPriority''^?^` is None:
 .. Group non-specified:
  ... If `tableContext'.MODE` matches pattern `NOPRI`:
   .... Result in the updated table context `tableContext'` and the typed table entry priority `?()`.
  ... Let `matchMode` be `tableContext'.MODE`.
  ... Else if let `NOPRILPM n` be `matchMode`:
   .... Let!~type~ `LPM n~prefix~` be `TBLS`.
   .... Result in the updated table context `tableContext'` and the typed table entry priority `?()`.
  ... If `tableContext'.MODE` matches pattern `PRI`:
   .... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is equal to `[ ]`:
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `n~size~` be `tableContext'.ENTRIES.SIZE`.
     ...... Let `n~delta~` be `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.DELTA`.
     ...... Let `int` be `n~size~ - 1 * n~delta~ + 1`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D n :`.
    ..... Else `~tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', 1)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D 1 :`.
   .... Else `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is not equal to `[ ]`:
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `n~last~` be `<<find_table_priority_last, $find_table_priority_last(tableContext')>>`.
     ...... Let `n~delta~` be `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.DELTA`.
     ...... Let `int` be `n~last~ - n~delta~`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D n :`.
    ..... Else `~tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `n~last~` be `<<find_table_priority_last, $find_table_priority_last(tableContext')>>`.
     ...... Let `n~delta~` be `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.DELTA`.
     ...... Let `n` be `n~last~ + n~delta~`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D n :`.
  ... Else if `tableContext'.MODE` matches pattern `PRILPM`:
   .... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is equal to `[ ]`:
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `n~size~` be `tableContext'.ENTRIES.SIZE`.
     ...... Let `n~delta~` be `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.DELTA`.
     ...... Let `int` be `n~size~ - 1 * n~delta~ + 1`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D n :`.
    ..... Else `~tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', 1)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D 1 :`.
   .... Else `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is not equal to `[ ]`:
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `n~last~` be `<<find_table_priority_last, $find_table_priority_last(tableContext')>>`.
     ...... Let `n~delta~` be `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.DELTA`.
     ...... Let `int` be `n~last~ - n~delta~`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D n :`.
    ..... Else `~tableContext'.PRIORITIES.LARGEST_WINS`:
     ...... Let `n~last~` be `<<find_table_priority_last, $find_table_priority_last(tableContext')>>`.
     ...... Let `n~delta~` be `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.DELTA`.
     ...... Let `n` be `n~last~ + n~delta~`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = D n :`.
. Else let `?tableEntryPriority` be `tableEntryPriority''^?^`:
 .. If let `PRIORITY = numberLiteral :` be `tableEntryPriority`:
  ... Group specified-number:
   .... If `tableContext'.MODE` matches pattern `PRI`:
    ..... Check that `~tableContext'.ENTRIES.CONST`.
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is equal to `[ ]`:
     ...... Let `int` be `<<to_number, $to_number(numberLiteral)>>`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `tableContext'`[PRIORITIES.INIT = true].
     ...... Let `TBLC~2~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(TBLC~1~, n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~2~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = numberLiteral :`.
    ..... Else `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is not equal to `[ ]`:
     ...... Check that `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.INIT`.
     ...... Let `int` be `<<to_number, $to_number(numberLiteral)>>`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = numberLiteral :`.
   .... Else if `tableContext'.MODE` matches pattern `PRILPM`:
    ..... Check that `~tableContext'.ENTRIES.CONST`.
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is equal to `[ ]`:
     ...... Let `int` be `<<to_number, $to_number(numberLiteral)>>`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `tableContext'`[PRIORITIES.INIT = true].
     ...... Let `TBLC~2~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(TBLC~1~, n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~2~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = numberLiteral :`.
    ..... Else `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is not equal to `[ ]`:
     ...... Check that `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.INIT`.
     ...... Let `int` be `<<to_number, $to_number(numberLiteral)>>`.
     ...... Let!~type~ `n` be `int`.
     ...... Let `TBLC~1~` be `<<add_table_priority, $add_table_priority(tableContext', n)>>`.
     ...... Result in the updated table context `TBLC~1~` and the typed table entry priority `?PRIORITY = numberLiteral :`.
 .. Else let `PRIORITY = ( expression ) :` be `tableEntryPriority`:
  ... Group specified-expression:
   .... If `tableContext'.MODE` matches pattern `PRI`:
    ..... Check that `~tableContext'.ENTRIES.CONST`.
    ..... If `tableContext'.PRIORITIES.VALUES` is equal to `[ ]`:
     ...... Let `typedExpressionIR` be the result of <<Expr_ok, typing `expression`, under cursor `LOCAL` and typing context `TC`>>.
     ...... Check that `<<ctk_of_expression, $ctk_of_expression(typedExpressionIR)>>` matches pattern `LCTK`.
     ...... Let `value` be the result of <<Eval_static, the local compile-time evaluation of `typedExpressionIR`, under cursor `LOCAL` and typing context `TC`>>.
     ...... Let `int` be `<<to_number, $to_number(value)>>`.
