. Else let `constOpt keysetExpression : tableActionReference annotationList ;` be `tableEntry`:
 .. Group non-priority:
  ... Let `TBLS` and `keysetExpressionIR` be the result of <<TableEntry_keyset_ok, typing `keysetExpression`, under typing context `TC` and table context `TBLC~0~`>>.
  ... Let `tableActionReferenceIR` be the result of <<TableEntry_action_ok, typing `tableActionReference`, under typing context `TC` and table context `TBLC~0~`>>.
