  ... Let `parserLocalDeclaration^{asterisk}^` be <<flatten_parserLocalDeclarationList, the list of parser local declarations in `parserLocalDeclarationList`>>.
  ... Let `TC~4~` and `parserLocalDeclarationIR^{asterisk}^` be the result of <<ParserLocalDecls_ok, typing `parserLocalDeclaration^{asterisk}^`, under typing context `TC~3~`>>.
  ... Let `TC~5~` be `TC~4~`[LOCAL.KIND = `PARSER_STATE`].
  ... Let `parserState^{asterisk}^` be <<flatten_parserStateList, the list of parser states in `parserStateList`>>.
