    ..... Let `TC~6~` be `<<add_constructor, $add_constructor(TC~0~, cid, constructorTypeDefIR)>>`.
    ..... Let `nameIR` be <<name, the name of `name`>>.
    ..... Let `parserDeclarationIR` be `annotationList PARSER nameIR < [ ] > ( parameterIR^{asterisk}^ ) ( constructorParameterIR^{asterisk}^ ) { parserLocalDeclarationIR^{asterisk}^ parserStateIR^{asterisk}^ }`.
    ..... Result in the modified typing context `TC~6~` and the typed declaration `parserDeclarationIR`.
