+
for each `type~field~` in `type~field~^{asterisk}^`
  ... Let `tid~impl~^{asterisk}^` be `<<concat_, $concat_<tid>(tid~impl_field~^{asterisk}^^{asterisk}^)>>`.
  ... Let `nameIR` be <<name, the name of `name`>>.
  ... Let `nameIR~field~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `nameIR~field~`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
      * Let `nameIR~field~` be <<name, the name of `name~field~`>>.
--
+
for each `name~field~` in `name~field~^{asterisk}^`
  ... Let `typeIR~struct~` be `STRUCT nameIR { typeIR~field~ nameIR~field~ ;^{asterisk}^ }`.
  ... Let `typeDefIR~struct~` be `typeIR~struct~ < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ >`.
  ... If <<TypeDef_wf, `typeDefIR~struct~` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `<<bound, $bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~)>>`>>:
