   .... Let `structTypeDeclarationIR` be `annotationList STRUCT nameIR < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ > { annotationList~field~ typeIR~field~ nameIR~field~ ;^{asterisk}^ }`.
