--
      * Let `nameIR~f~` be <<name, the name of `name~f~`>>.
--
+
for each `name~f~` in `name~f~^{asterisk}^`
  ... Let `typeIR~union~` be `HEADER_UNION nameIR { typeIR~f~ nameIR~f~ ;^{asterisk}^ }`.
  ... Let `typeDefIR~union~` be `typeIR~union~ < tid~expl~^{asterisk}^ , tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ >`.
  ... If <<TypeDef_wf, `typeDefIR~union~` is a well-formed type, assuming bound type ids `<<bound, $bound(GLOBAL, TC~0~)>>`>>:
